msgid "Some files were not extracted from the volumes marked with the exclamation point, try to press the button 'Install From Exapack Files' below a short additional step will be executed to force the extraction of the files. If the problem persists with that volume, try to download it again from your download page."
msgstr "部分带有感叹号标记的卷中的文件未能解压，请按下下方的“从 Exapack 文件安装”按钮，将执行一个额外的步骤来强制提取这些文件。如果该问题仍然存在，请尝试再次从下载页面下载该卷。"

