msgid "Generate a json file in ._data with the dimensions of all zipped files, it zips the files and calculates the size of the zipped file, so that when exapack are created, they are all calculated based on the actual size of the zipped packages. Useful to keep the dimensions of the exapack files as close as possible to the size of 2 GB per package, because some users may have timeout problems with too large files. Especially on Blendermarket."
